meta {
  name: 14. Cleanup - Delete Assignment
  type: http
  seq: 28
}

delete {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/assignments/:id
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  id: {{sagaAssignmentId}}
}

tests {
  test("Assignment deleted or already gone", function() {
    const status = res.getStatus();
    // 204=deleted, 404=already gone, 400=invalid ID
    expect(status === 204 || status === 404 || status === 400).to.be.true;
  });
}

docs {
  **Saga step 14 of 18** — Delete the scoped assignment (cleanup).

  Removes the DATASET-scoped assignment created in step 6. This should be done before deleting the dataset to avoid dangling references.

  **Expected Response:** 204 No Content. 404 if already deleted. 400 if the ID is invalid (not set on first run).

  **System Impact:**

  | System | Expected Change |
  |---|---|
  | Backend | Assignment record removed from `portal_backend` DB |
  | Config Adapter | AuthZ Repository notified to invalidate its authorization data cache |
  | AuthZ Repository (OPA) | Scoped role-group binding removed from OPA policy data |
}
